@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram

:管理员: as Admin
(应用配置) as ApplyDiff
(查看差异) as ViewDiff
(查看配置) as GetRuntimeConfig
(保存配置) as SaveRuntimeConfig

Admin -> ApplyDiff
Admin --> SaveRuntimeConfig
ApplyDiff --> GetRuntimeConfig
ApplyDiff --> ViewDiff

(租户启用) as CreateTenant
(租户下开启应用) as EnableAppForTenant
(应用升级) as AppUpgrade

(应用的系统配置) as AppSystemConfig
(应用的租户级基础配置) as AppTenantFundamentalConfig


@enduml
